          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports marked distress most days when away from partner or home; says she feels physically sick and cannot focus when her partner is out for the day."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
